<#ff962a>GRIP GAUGE</>
Grip gauge (bottom of the screen)
  Every grab that connects fills the gauge: throws and Sleeper
  Hold a little, Air Knee Smash and the Boomerang Raid grab
  more, Power Bomb / Spiral D.D.T. / Stun Gun Headbutt more
  still, Hyper Bomb most. The fuller the gauge, the harder his
  throws and command grabs hit: up to +50% at full. It is never
  spent and it carries over between rounds. A new match
  starts it empty again. X on its own does nothing: X held with
  A / B / C is the kick button.

<#ff962a>SYSTEM</>
Grab		^Y
  Back or forward with it picks the throw direction.
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves him open.
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on him passes 15% of his life.
Zero Counter (while guarding, 1 bar)		_B_DB_D^A / ^B / ^C
Dash / Back Step		_F_F / _B_B
High Jump		_D_U
Overhaul (next attack counter-hits)		Start

<#ff962a>NORMALS</>
  Punches are A / B / C. Kicks are X held with A / B / C.
  Chain: A > B > C on hit or block (stand, crouch, air), upward only.
  Any connected normal cancels into specials, EX moves and Boomerang Raid.
Light / Medium / Heavy punch		^A / ^B / ^C
Light / Medium / Heavy kick		^X_+^A / ^X_+^B / ^X_+^C
Crouching punches		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Crouching kicks		_D^X_+^A / _D^X_+^B / _D^X_+^C
Air punches		^A / ^B / ^C
Air kicks		^X_+^A / ^X_+^B / ^X_+^C
Chop (overhead)		_F^B
Lariat		_F^C
Headbutt (Sleeper Hold on a back-turned foe)		_B^C
Flying Cross Chop (air, overhead)		_D^C
Target Combo 1		_D^X_+^A, _D^X_+^B
Target Combo 2		_D^X_+^A, _D^X_+^C
  Standing heavy punch spikes air foes, standing heavy kick
  knocks them down.

<#ff962a>SPECIALS</>
  A and B are the Light and Medium versions. C is the EX
  version (500 meter); with under 500 meter it is the Heavy.
Flash Chop		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Slash Elbow (hold back first)		_B_F^X_+^A / ^B / ^C
Air Stampede (hold down first)		_D_U^X_+^A / ^B / ^C
Power Bomb (command grab)		_F_DF_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Spiral D.D.T. (command grab, standing foes)		_F_DF_D_DB_B^X_+^A / ^B / ^C
Air Knee Smash (command grab, airborne foes)		_F_D_DF^X_+^A / ^B / ^C
  Power Bomb, Spiral D.D.T. and Air Knee Smash are unblockable
  and hit harder as the grip gauge fills.

<#ff962a>EX MOVES (500 meter, C button)</>
EX Flash Chop		_D_DF_F^C
EX Slash Elbow (armored start)		_B_F^X_+^C
EX Air Stampede		_D_U^X_+^C
EX Power Bomb		_F_DF_D_DB_B^C
EX Spiral D.D.T.		_F_DF_D_DB_B^X_+^C
EX Air Knee Smash		_F_D_DF^X_+^C

<#ff962a>SUPERS</>
Boomerang Raid (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Stun Gun Headbutt (1 bar, command grab)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Hyper Bomb (5 bars, command grab)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^C
  The supers that grab are boosted by the grip gauge too.
